# ---------------------------------------------------------------- First loop: south-east and north-east

step Bears and the Blackwood camp
  tip Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills south of Auberdine: use Tharnariun's Hope on one to capture it. Then walk up to the furbolg camp just east of them: nothing to kill yet.
  complete 2118 @38.21,52.59 map 1439 era -- the Rabid Thistle Bears nearest Tharnariun
  complete 984 @39.9,53.9                     # any of four furbolg camps completes it; this is the one by the bears (#560)

step Ameth'Aran
  tip Sentinel Tysha Moonblade stands at the north edge of the ruins. Cursed, Writhing and Wailing Highborne haunt them; Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks among them, Jai'vhanel the owl circles east of them. The two tablets lie in the ruins; a Beached Sea Turtle lies on the shore west of them.
  accept 4722                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 953                                  -- Sentinel Tysha Moonblade
  collect 5360 quest 958                      -- Highborne Relics
  collect 281038 quest 98025                  -- Feather of Jai'vhanel
  interact 17188 quest 953.1                  -- Read the Lay of Ameth'Aran
  interact 17189 quest 953.2                  -- Read the Fall of Ameth'Aran
  turnin 953

step The red crystal
  tip Climb the eastern mountains east of Ameth'Aran; the Mysterious Red Crystal sits on a ledge.
  interact 175524 quest 4811.1                -- Mysterious Red Crystal
  complete 4811

